DESCRIPTION:Craig Robinson most notably portrayed acerbic Dunder-Mifflin em
 ployee Darryl Philbin on the Emmy-winning “The Office” on NBC. He is de
 finitely a world away from his original career intentions\; before deciding
  to pursue his comedy career full time\, Robinson was a K-8 teacher in the 
 Chicago Public School System. It was while he was studying education in Chi
 cago that he also discovered his love of acting and comedy when he joined t
 he famed Second City Theatre.\n\nAs a stand-up comedian\, Robinson first ma
 de his mark in the comedy circuit at the 1998 Montreal Just For Laughs Fest
 ival. That year\, he also won the Oakland Comedy Festival\nAwards and the M
 iller Genuine Draft 1996 Comedy Search. He soon went on to perform his act 
 on “The Jimmy Kimmel Show" and “Real Time with Bill Maher.” Now headl
 ining venues and festivals across the country\, he does both solo acts as w
 ell as full-band sets – “The Nasty Delicious” – tying together his 
 lyrical comedy with his finesse at the piano. Whether Robinson shows up wit
 h just his keyboard or his seven-man band\, the clubs are packed to the bri
 m with raucous laughter and musical comedy.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n
 \n- 2 premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratu
 ity\n- Ticket Protection\n\n**The Private Skybox Suite includes up to 10 ti
 ckets\, a $400 Food & Beverage voucher\, a personal server\, a private rest
 room\, and all gratuity charges.\n\nAny additional food and drink costs abo
 ve $400 will be billed at the end of the show. The guest count can not exce
 ed 10 people. All club policies and safety guidelines will be enforced. Ple
 ase note that the skybox is on the second floor of our showroom\, and is NO
 T wheelchair accessible.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent custom
 ers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to oth
 er patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-
 event-craig-robinson-21642/
